desc:E-Drum Pad Levels (volume per pad)
//tags: MIDI processing drums
// Scales the hit strength (velocity) of each MIDI note, so a weak or older pad can be evened out.
// One hidden setting per note (0-127). Kit Manager fills them from the drum module profile,
// the Pad levels window and the loaded kit. Part of E-Drum Kit Manager.

slider1:100<25,300,1>-Note 0 (%)
slider2:100<25,300,1>-Note 1 (%)
slider3:100<25,300,1>-Note 2 (%)
